    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβολ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything put in</i>: <i>piston</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, cf. Hsch.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίουρος</span>
			; <i>peg</i>, Anthem.<i><span class="en">
				pp.151,152
			</span></i> W.; <i>dibble</i> or <i>stick for setting plants,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
